WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:02.267
-Steve Bannon, the former

00:00:02.267 --> 00:00:03.734
chief strategist
to President Trump,

00:00:03.734 --> 00:00:05.734
turned himself in
to federal authorities today

00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:08.701
after being indicted for defying
a congressional subpoena.

00:00:08.701 --> 00:00:10.100
Trump himself, meanwhile,

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.834
defended the violent mob
that chanted "Hang Mike Pence"

00:00:12.834 --> 00:00:14.367
during the insurrection
on January 6th.

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:16.234
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:16.234 --> 00:00:21.000
[ Cheering and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.734
Just to get you guys
up to speed,

00:00:22.734 --> 00:00:24.000
you remember Steve Bannon,

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.901
the former chief strategist
to President Trump,

00:00:25.901 --> 00:00:27.667
who looks like
his morning beauty routine is

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:29.701
to take a peek
inside the Ark of the Covenant.

00:00:29.701 --> 00:00:32.367
[ Laughter ]
By the way,

00:00:32.367 --> 00:00:34.100
I know,
when I reference that scene,

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.100
that most people think
of the guy whose face melted,

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.667
but let's not forget
a dude's head also exploded.

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:40.133
[ Laughter ]
That dude doesn't get

00:00:40.133 --> 00:00:41.634
enough recognition.

00:00:41.634 --> 00:00:42.901
Probably because his
head exploded.

00:00:42.901 --> 00:00:44.200
[ Laughter ]
I bet, when he goes

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.100
to conventions, now,
to sign autographs, he's like,

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:47.367
"It's me, Head Explosion Guy

00:00:47.367 --> 00:00:48.667
from 'Raiders of the Lost Ark,'"
and people are like,

00:00:48.667 --> 00:00:50.234
"Sorry, we don't recognize you
with a head."

00:00:50.234 --> 00:00:51.634
[ Laughter ]
And he's like,

00:00:51.634 --> 00:00:52.767
"Damn you, George Lucas

00:00:52.767 --> 00:00:54.968
and your fantastic
special effects team!"

00:00:54.968 --> 00:00:57.200
[ Laughter ]
I'm just kidding.
That guy's name is Paul Freeman

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:58.367
and he's outstanding.

00:00:58.367 --> 00:01:00.434
[ Laughter and applause ]
Boy, we got to --

00:01:00.434 --> 00:01:01.901
we got to start tying
our tangents in

00:01:01.901 --> 00:01:03.067
to the rest of the show.

00:01:03.067 --> 00:01:04.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.133 --> 00:01:05.601
I'll land the next one.

00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:07.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:09.934
Bannon's already been arrested
once before.

00:01:09.934 --> 00:01:12.200
It was last year,
during Trump's presidency,

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:14.467
and he was arrested
by Postal Service inspectors

00:01:14.467 --> 00:01:16.300
aboard a Chinese
billionaire's yacht,

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:18.601
for allegedly scamming
Trump supporters

00:01:18.601 --> 00:01:21.200
who donated
to a crowdfunding scheme

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:23.100
to buy Trump's wall,
or as they call that,

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.601
in the law enforcement
community, a Code 6.

00:01:25.601 --> 00:01:27.634
-Steve Bannon
and three other men

00:01:27.634 --> 00:01:30.868
have been arrested
and indicted and charged

00:01:30.868 --> 00:01:32.634
in relation to their role

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:35.234
in a nonprofit organization
called We Build the Wall.

00:01:35.234 --> 00:01:38.534
What the indictment here
is alleging is

00:01:38.534 --> 00:01:41.334
that Bannon and these others
were skimming some

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:44.968
of the proceeds from that
fundraising for themselves.

00:01:44.968 --> 00:01:46.767
-The court documents
basically say

00:01:46.767 --> 00:01:49.801
that this thing was
pretty suspect,

00:01:49.801 --> 00:01:51.767
almost from the beginning.

00:01:51.767 --> 00:01:53.100
-Yeah, I would say so.

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:55.400
The only way it could've been
more obviously a scam is

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:56.901
if people who donated
were offered

00:01:56.901 --> 00:01:59.601
an extended car warranty
and fake boner pills for life.

00:01:59.601 --> 00:02:01.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.267 --> 00:02:02.367
So, Bannon was arrested

00:02:02.367 --> 00:02:03.901
for scamming Trump's
own supporters,

00:02:03.901 --> 00:02:05.901
but then, Trump pardoned him
at the last minute

00:02:05.901 --> 00:02:07.734
and Bannon made
this mysterious prediction

00:02:07.734 --> 00:02:10.234
the day before the
January 6th insurrection.

00:02:10.234 --> 00:02:11.567
-It's not going to happen

00:02:11.567 --> 00:02:13.100
like you think it's going
to happen, okay?

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:16.133
It's going to be quite
extraordinarily different.

00:02:16.133 --> 00:02:18.400
And all I can say is strap in.

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:20.534
The "War Room" posse,

00:02:20.534 --> 00:02:21.901
you have made this happen

00:02:21.901 --> 00:02:24.400
and, tomorrow, it's game day,
so strap in.

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:26.200
All hell is going

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:28.300
to break loose tomorrow.

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:30.133
Just understand this.
All hell is going

00:02:30.133 --> 00:02:31.334
to break loose tomorrow.

00:02:31.334 --> 00:02:32.734
-And I'm no detective,

00:02:32.734 --> 00:02:34.767
but it sounds like
he knew something was up.

00:02:34.767 --> 00:02:36.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:36.467 --> 00:02:38.534
It's like if Nicole Kidman
had found a text

00:02:38.534 --> 00:02:39.834
on Hugh Grant's phone saying...

00:02:41.567 --> 00:02:42.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.934 --> 00:02:44.634
And, if you haven't seen
"The Undoing" yet,

00:02:44.634 --> 00:02:46.400
I didn't necessarily
just spoil it.

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:47.634
You don't know
what he did with the hammer.

00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:49.601
Maybe he built
his mistress a house.

00:02:49.601 --> 00:02:51.601
Spoiler alert --
he didn't build her a house.

00:02:51.601 --> 00:02:54.367
[ Laughter ]
Besides, you don't watch
"The Undoing" for the mystery.

00:02:54.367 --> 00:02:56.033
You watch it for the scarves.

00:02:56.033 --> 00:02:57.634
Nicole Kidman layers scarves

00:02:57.634 --> 00:02:59.434
the way Bannon layers
collared shirts.

00:02:59.434 --> 00:03:00.534
[ Laughter ]
And will you look at that?

00:03:00.534 --> 00:03:02.234
We have landed the tangent.

00:03:02.234 --> 00:03:04.934
[ Cheering and applause ]
I mean, I think it almost --

00:03:07.667 --> 00:03:09.968
I think, technically,
it counts as a segue way now.

00:03:09.968 --> 00:03:13.033
[ Laughter ]
So, naturally, the congressional
committee investigating

00:03:13.033 --> 00:03:15.467
the January 6th insurrection
wanted to talk to Bannon,

00:03:15.467 --> 00:03:18.000
but he defied the subpoena,
at Trump's request;

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:20.767
Congress held him in contempt;
a grand jury indicted him;

00:03:20.767 --> 00:03:22.033
and today, he turned himself in,

00:03:22.033 --> 00:03:24.634
although, this time,
it was much less glamorous

00:03:24.634 --> 00:03:26.701
than getting arrested
on a billionaire's yacht.

00:03:26.701 --> 00:03:29.868
-Trump ally former White House
advisor Steve Bannon.

00:03:29.868 --> 00:03:32.000
He is expected to surrender
to authorities

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:33.467
after being indicted

00:03:33.467 --> 00:03:36.067
on two counts
of contempt of Congress,

00:03:36.067 --> 00:03:39.300
this for defying requests
from the January 6th Committee,

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:41.434
for testimony and documents.

00:03:41.434 --> 00:03:42.901
Defying subpoenas.

00:03:42.901 --> 00:03:45.267
You're looking at live pictures
of Bannon's home right now.

00:03:45.267 --> 00:03:46.534
-Got to say,
Bannon's house looks

00:03:46.534 --> 00:03:48.200
a lot more normal
than I was expecting.

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:50.667
I thought I was going to be
a little more like a burrow

00:03:50.667 --> 00:03:53.100
[ Laughter and applause ]
or a volcano
in the shape of a skull,

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:55.601
or he'd layer them,
like his shirts,

00:03:55.601 --> 00:03:57.501
and it would be a house
inside a second,

00:03:57.501 --> 00:03:59.501
[ Laughter and applause ]
slightly larger, house.

00:03:59.501 --> 00:04:01.701
I also know
we just made that joke.

00:04:01.701 --> 00:04:04.200
So, Bannon's house
looks normal on the outside,

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:06.601
although, I bet you
it's much weirder inside.

00:04:06.601 --> 00:04:09.167
It's like when you finally meet
a neighbor who keeps to himself

00:04:09.167 --> 00:04:11.467
and you think,
"He must just be a quiet guy,"

00:04:11.467 --> 00:04:12.801
and then, you go inside
and his sink

00:04:12.801 --> 00:04:14.100
is filled with old newspapers,

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:16.234
his fridge is stuffed
with takeout containers,

00:04:16.234 --> 00:04:18.634
and the shelves are filled
with antique ceramic pigs.

00:04:18.634 --> 00:04:21.334
Also, your neighbor is
Rudy Giuliani.

00:04:21.334 --> 00:04:23.434
[ Laughter and applause ]
[ As Giuliani ]
You want some mayo?

00:04:23.434 --> 00:04:24.901
You want some mayo?
I scraped off the mold.

00:04:24.901 --> 00:04:26.467
It's mostly jar now.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:26.467 --> 00:04:29.133
And then, when Bannon
finally showed up

00:04:29.133 --> 00:04:31.367
at the courthouse this morning
to turn himself in,

00:04:31.367 --> 00:04:34.968
he, of course, couldn't help but
shout some incomprehensible,

00:04:34.968 --> 00:04:37.133
anti-government babble
into a camera.

00:04:37.133 --> 00:04:38.701
-We're taking down
the Biden regime.

00:04:38.701 --> 00:04:40.000
Every day, the focus.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:41.400
You got Raheem Kassam today,

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:44.167
you got Dr. Peter Navarro,
Captain Bannon.

00:04:44.167 --> 00:04:45.968
You're going to have
Boris Epshteyn.

00:04:45.968 --> 00:04:47.634
The whole show, intense.

00:04:47.634 --> 00:04:50.934
We got polling out,
economic data out -- everything.

00:04:50.934 --> 00:04:53.100
I want you guys to stay focused,
stay on message.

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:54.567
Remember -- signal, not noise.

00:04:54.567 --> 00:04:56.467
This is all noise.
That's signal.

00:04:56.467 --> 00:04:58.901
-Wait, I'm sorry. You call
yourself Captain Bannon now?

00:04:58.901 --> 00:05:00.133
[ Laughter ]

00:05:00.133 --> 00:05:02.400
It's like an ironic nickname
they give the guy

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:06.033
who rinses out the chum buckets
down at the marina.

00:05:06.033 --> 00:05:07.400
[ Hoarsely ] Hurry up
with those buckets, Bannon,

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:08.868
we got barnacles to scrape.

00:05:08.868 --> 00:05:12.234
[ Laughter and applause ]
Oh, excuse me, Captain Bannon.

00:05:12.234 --> 00:05:13.434
[ Laughter ]

00:05:13.434 --> 00:05:15.167
Also, it really undercuts

00:05:15.167 --> 00:05:17.167
your attempted defiance
and bravado

00:05:17.167 --> 00:05:18.601
when there's a guy
right behind you

00:05:18.601 --> 00:05:19.868
holding up a sign that says...

00:05:21.067 --> 00:05:22.934
[ Laughter ]

00:05:22.934 --> 00:05:25.000
Got to be a bummer
for a guy like Bannon,

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.534
who thinks he's
an evil mastermind,

00:05:26.534 --> 00:05:27.801
to get upstaged by a sign

00:05:27.801 --> 00:05:29.400
that clearly took
five minutes to make.

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:31.567
Or, one of Bannon's neighbors

00:05:31.567 --> 00:05:33.267
made it months ago,
just in case.

00:05:33.267 --> 00:05:35.200
"Oh, what's that for, honey?"

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:36.334
Oh, I don't know.

00:05:36.334 --> 00:05:38.100
I just feel like
we might need it, one day.

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:39.868
[ Laughter ]

00:05:39.868 --> 00:05:43.167
Bannon definitely likes to think
of himself as a Logan Roy type,

00:05:43.167 --> 00:05:44.834
but he's more like
a coked-up flunky

00:05:44.834 --> 00:05:47.434
who'd get hired to help
Cousin Greg shred some documents

00:05:47.434 --> 00:05:49.300
[ Laughter ]
and accidentally screw it up.

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:51.367
[ As Greg ]
Um, I'm pretty sure
that, uh, Tom told us

00:05:51.367 --> 00:05:55.400
not to peruse any
of the confidential materials,

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:58.534
or, in his words,
I'd have to, uh,

00:05:58.534 --> 00:05:59.601
"Eat a thousand [bleep]."

00:05:59.601 --> 00:06:01.834
[ Laughter ]
This is just one step

00:06:01.834 --> 00:06:04.367
in the process of holding Trump
and his cronies accountable

00:06:04.367 --> 00:06:06.901
for their assault on democracy,
and it's absolutely necessary

00:06:06.901 --> 00:06:08.467
because Bannon's not alone.

00:06:08.467 --> 00:06:10.734
Virtually the entire
institutional Republican Party

00:06:10.734 --> 00:06:13.067
has made it clear
they remain fully devoted

00:06:13.067 --> 00:06:14.667
to Donald Trump
and his ongoing attempt

00:06:14.667 --> 00:06:16.601
to unravel
our constitutional order.

00:06:16.601 --> 00:06:19.000
And I'm not just talking
about the obvious crazies --

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:21.067
the Matt Gaetzes,
Marjorie Taylor Greenes,

00:06:21.067 --> 00:06:23.567
Paul Gosars, and Louie Gohmert
of the world.

00:06:23.567 --> 00:06:25.334
Or, as Gaetz called them,
last week...

00:06:25.334 --> 00:06:26.534
-The Killer G's.

00:06:26.534 --> 00:06:28.300
We've heard of the killer bees,
[ Laughter ]

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:33.567
but now, it's Greene, Gosar,
Gaetz, Good, Gohmert.

00:06:33.567 --> 00:06:35.734
-The Killer G's
is a good name for that group,

00:06:35.734 --> 00:06:38.033
as, every time you remember
they're elected officials,

00:06:38.033 --> 00:06:41.534
your reaction is,
"Kill me" or "Jes...us!"

00:06:41.534 --> 00:06:43.100
[ Laughter ]

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:46.133
Also, you'd think, if you had,
within the last 12 months,

00:06:46.133 --> 00:06:48.033
helped foment
a violent insurrection

00:06:48.033 --> 00:06:49.534
where rioters actually chanted

00:06:49.534 --> 00:06:51.267
they wanted to kill
the vice president,

00:06:51.267 --> 00:06:53.033
you wouldn't go
by the Killer G's.

00:06:53.033 --> 00:06:54.133
It's just a little
too on the nose.

00:06:54.133 --> 00:06:55.801
[ Laughter ]
It's like if we found out

00:06:55.801 --> 00:06:56.968
The New York Times Spelling Bee

00:06:56.968 --> 00:06:58.567
was designed
by the Zodiac Killer,

00:06:58.567 --> 00:07:01.133
which wouldn't surprise me.

00:07:01.133 --> 00:07:03.667
[ Laughter ]
Only a seriously twisted mind
could come up

00:07:03.667 --> 00:07:05.767
with such an elaborate form
of psychological torture.

00:07:05.767 --> 00:07:07.300
Yesterday,
I spent the entire day trying

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:08.667
to find every last word
in the puzzle

00:07:08.667 --> 00:07:11.133
and, when my kids asked me
what they could do

00:07:11.133 --> 00:07:13.300
to get me to make them dinner,
I said,

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:14.634
"Find me a word that uses

00:07:14.634 --> 00:07:17.567
all seven of these letters!"
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:17.567 --> 00:07:19.033
Because the center one
is a real...

00:07:19.033 --> 00:07:20.033
-Killer G.

00:07:20.033 --> 00:07:21.567
[ Laughter ]
I mean, seriously,

00:07:21.567 --> 00:07:24.033
the Killer G's is one of the
dumbest names I've ever heard.

00:07:24.033 --> 00:07:26.868
Did you steal it from a senior
citizens' bowling team?

00:07:26.868 --> 00:07:28.300
[ Laughter ]
That's a cute name, Grandpa.

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:29.334
Where'd you come up with it?

00:07:29.334 --> 00:07:30.901
"Well, the "G" stands
for Grandpa

00:07:30.901 --> 00:07:32.334
and the Killer, well,
let's just say

00:07:32.334 --> 00:07:34.334
I did some things in my youth
that I'm not too proud of."

00:07:34.334 --> 00:07:36.133
[ Laughter ]
Times were tough back then

00:07:36.133 --> 00:07:38.367
and we had to survive.
I got involved in things

00:07:38.367 --> 00:07:40.434
I don't understand --
gambling, crime, drugs.

00:07:40.434 --> 00:07:42.801
I'm talking cocaine,
methamphetamine, heroin.

00:07:42.801 --> 00:07:45.334
[ Laughter ]
Once you ride the black dragon,

00:07:45.334 --> 00:07:46.701
there's no telling
what you'll do.

00:07:46.701 --> 00:07:49.200
[ Laughter ]
I...choked a man
for a pint of gin.

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:50.467
[ Laughter ]
He was a drifter.

00:07:50.467 --> 00:07:52.133
Saw the life drain
out of his eyes.

00:07:52.133 --> 00:07:53.667
His body went limp in my hands.
[ Laughter ]

00:07:53.667 --> 00:07:55.934
Buried the body
in the Pine Barrens.

00:07:55.934 --> 00:07:58.534
I left -- I left so many clues!

00:07:58.534 --> 00:08:01.200
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:02.767
Technically, it's a pangram.

00:08:02.767 --> 00:08:04.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:05.734
But it's not just
the so-called Killer G's

00:08:05.734 --> 00:08:08.601
who have fully bought into Trump
and the GOP's ongoing coup.

00:08:08.601 --> 00:08:10.934
For example, last week,
ABC released audio

00:08:10.934 --> 00:08:14.067
of an interview in which
Trump defended the violent mob

00:08:14.067 --> 00:08:16.501
that stormed the Capitol
and chanted, "Hang Mike Pence"

00:08:16.501 --> 00:08:18.801
after Pence declined to overturn
the election results.

00:08:52.767 --> 00:08:55.100
The most shocking thing
about that clip is,

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:56.534
when I heard it,
my reaction was,

00:08:56.534 --> 00:08:58.167
"Alright, that tracks."

00:08:58.167 --> 00:08:59.334
[ Laughter ]
I mean, it checks pretty much

00:08:59.334 --> 00:09:00.601
every Trump box --

00:09:00.601 --> 00:09:02.701
"I wasn't worried
about another person's safety.

00:09:02.701 --> 00:09:03.868
They kind of deserved it.

00:09:03.868 --> 00:09:05.701
Also, did I mention
that I won the election?"

00:09:05.701 --> 00:09:07.267
I mean, at this point,
the only way I'm clicking

00:09:07.267 --> 00:09:09.567
on a link to Trump audio is
if the headline reads...

00:09:12.234 --> 00:09:13.367
[ Laughter ]

00:09:13.367 --> 00:09:14.367
[ As Trump ]
I [bleep] up, Sean.

00:09:14.367 --> 00:09:15.667
I [bleep] up bad and I --

00:09:15.667 --> 00:09:17.601
[ Laughter ]
I put my friend's life at risk.

00:09:17.601 --> 00:09:18.734
Dear Mike, sweet Mike.

00:09:18.734 --> 00:09:19.868
[ Laughter ]
I hope he can --

00:09:19.868 --> 00:09:21.033
I hope he can forgive me
and, if he doesn't,

00:09:21.033 --> 00:09:22.334
I wouldn't blame him
for a second.

00:09:22.334 --> 00:09:23.934
The worst part, Sean,
I knew I lost that election.

00:09:23.934 --> 00:09:26.167
I couldn't admit it.
[ Laughter ]

00:09:26.167 --> 00:09:28.601
I don't know why --
I think it's dad stuff, Sean,

00:09:28.601 --> 00:09:30.734
[ Laughter ]
and, if I'm being honest
with myself,

00:09:30.734 --> 00:09:32.067
until I deal with the dad stuff,

00:09:32.067 --> 00:09:33.968
I'm not going to be
the best version of myself.

00:09:33.968 --> 00:09:37.200
[ Laughter ]

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:39.334
I mean, it's like Melania says
to me every day...

00:09:39.334 --> 00:09:41.334
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:41.334 --> 00:09:43.701
Now, you'd think any sane human
being would desperately want

00:09:43.701 --> 00:09:46.067
to disassociate themselves
from that, and yet,

00:09:46.067 --> 00:09:48.100
when he was asked
about Trump's comment on Sunday,

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:49.567
Wyoming Senator John Barrasso,

00:09:49.567 --> 00:09:51.467
by no means considered one
of the Killer G's --

00:09:51.467 --> 00:09:53.834
I mean, he'd have to change
his name to Garrasso --

00:09:53.834 --> 00:09:57.033
but, still, repeatedly,
he refused to criticize Trump

00:09:57.033 --> 00:09:59.534
for defending the mob's call
to "Hang Mike Pence."

00:09:59.534 --> 00:10:01.200
-Can your party tolerate
a leader

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:05.133
who defends murderers' chants
against his own vice president?

00:10:05.133 --> 00:10:08.100
-Well, let me just say

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:12.234
the Republican Party
is incredibly united right now.

00:10:12.234 --> 00:10:14.968
-So you have no problem
with the president saying

00:10:14.968 --> 00:10:17.033
"Hang, Mike Pence"
is "common sense"?

00:10:19.667 --> 00:10:21.367
-I was with Mike Pence

00:10:21.367 --> 00:10:25.234
in the Senate chamber
during January 6th

00:10:25.234 --> 00:10:26.801
and what happened was

00:10:26.801 --> 00:10:29.434
they quickly got
Vice President Pence

00:10:29.434 --> 00:10:30.701
out of there.

00:10:30.701 --> 00:10:32.334
I didn't hear any
of those chants.

00:10:32.334 --> 00:10:33.601
-Well, we just played
the chants.

00:10:33.601 --> 00:10:35.434
I'm asking if you believe,

00:10:35.434 --> 00:10:37.634
if you can tolerate
the president saying

00:10:37.634 --> 00:10:40.033
"Hang Mike Pence"
is "common sense."

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:44.367
-It's not common sense.

00:10:44.367 --> 00:10:47.167
There are issues
of every election.

00:10:47.167 --> 00:10:48.767
-But you're not going
to criticize President Trump

00:10:48.767 --> 00:10:49.834
for those views?

00:10:52.434 --> 00:10:55.100
-I don't agree with
President Trump on everything.

00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:57.801
-[ As Barrasso ]
Look, George, the
Republican Party is a big tent.

00:10:57.801 --> 00:10:58.868
We don't agree on everything.

00:10:58.868 --> 00:11:00.467
Some of us are pro-war.

00:11:00.467 --> 00:11:01.601
Some of us are anti-war.

00:11:01.601 --> 00:11:03.067
Some of us are pro-vaccine.

00:11:03.067 --> 00:11:04.267
Some of us are anti-vaccine.

00:11:04.267 --> 00:11:06.067
Some of us want
to hang Mike Pence.

00:11:06.067 --> 00:11:10.100
Some of us don't hear when those
people chant, "Hang Mike Pence."

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:11.267
[ Laughter ]

00:11:11.267 --> 00:11:12.767
It's called inclusivity.

00:11:12.767 --> 00:11:13.834
[ Laughter ]
But that's the reality --

00:11:13.834 --> 00:11:15.267
as much as we like
to write it off

00:11:15.267 --> 00:11:16.501
as a fringe movement, it's not.

00:11:16.501 --> 00:11:17.834
It's the heart
of the modern GOP.

00:11:17.834 --> 00:11:19.901
Virtually the entire
institutional Republican Party,

00:11:19.901 --> 00:11:21.234
from the so-called Killer G's

00:11:21.234 --> 00:11:22.667
to the John Barrassos
of the world,

00:11:22.667 --> 00:11:24.701
have apparently decided that
their ticket back to power is

00:11:24.701 --> 00:11:26.000
an alliance with Trump

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.968
and a guy who looks like
he was stung by a swarm of...

00:11:27.968 --> 00:11:29.300
-Killer bees.
[ Laughter ]

00:11:29.300 --> 00:11:31.167
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:11:31.167 --> 00:11:34.801
♪♪

